<%- include('partials/head') %>

<div class="cursor" id="cursor" aria-hidden="true"></div>
<div class="cursor-follower" id="cursorFollower" aria-hidden="true"></div>
<%- include('partials/preloader') %>
<div class="page-transition" id="pageTransition" aria-hidden="true"></div>
<%- include('partials/header') %>

<main id="main" role="main">

  <!-- PAGE HERO -->
  <section class="page-hero" aria-labelledby="laHeroHeading">
    <div class="noise" aria-hidden="true"></div>
    <div class="hero__orb" aria-hidden="true"></div>
    <div class="container page-hero__inner">
      <span class="label-tag reveal-text">LOS ANGELES</span>
      <h1 class="page-hero__title split-heading" id="laHeroHeading">Keeping LA homes<br>comfortable — and rodent-free.</h1>
      <p class="page-hero__sub reveal-text">From attic insulation that cuts your LADWP bill to permanent rat exclusion on older LA homes — Insulara has protected over 4,800 Los Angeles County homes since 2009.</p>
      <div class="hero-cta reveal-text">
        <a href="/contact" class="btn btn--orange btn--xl btn--magnetic" data-magnetic>Book Your Free Inspection</a>
      </div>
    </div>
  </section>

  <!-- ==================== ENERGY EFFICIENCY ==================== -->
  <section class="service-detail" id="energy" aria-labelledby="energyHeading">
    <div class="container service-detail__grid">
      <div class="service-detail__body">
        <span class="label-tag reveal-text">ENERGY EFFICIENCY</span>
        <h2 class="service-detail__title split-heading" id="energyHeading">Why your LA home is losing money every month.</h2>
        <p class="service-detail__text reveal-text">Los Angeles summers push attic temperatures past 140°F. That heat radiates down through your ceiling, forcing your air conditioner to run nonstop — and your LADWP bill to climb. Most LA homes, especially those built between the 1950s and 1980s, were constructed with little to no attic insulation, or with insulation that has degraded over decades.</p>
        <p class="service-detail__text reveal-text">Proper attic insulation creates a thermal barrier that keeps that heat out in summer and holds warmth in during cooler months. The result: a home that stays comfortable without overworking your AC or heater — and monthly savings of 25–40% on your energy bill.</p>

        <div class="city-stats reveal-text" aria-label="Key facts">
          <div class="city-stat">
            <span class="city-stat__value">140°F+</span>
            <span class="city-stat__label">LA attic temps in summer</span>
          </div>
          <div class="city-stat">
            <span class="city-stat__value">40%</span>
            <span class="city-stat__label">Potential energy bill reduction</span>
          </div>
          <div class="city-stat">
            <span class="city-stat__value">Pre-1990</span>
            <span class="city-stat__label">Most LA homes are under-insulated</span>
          </div>
        </div>

        <ul class="service-detail__list reveal-text">
          <li>Blown-in attic insulation (R-38 to R-60)</li>
          <li>Complete attic air sealing before insulation</li>
          <li>Removal of old, degraded insulation</li>
          <li>Crawlspace and wall insulation</li>
          <li>California Title 24 compliant installations</li>
        </ul>
        <a href="/contact" class="btn btn--orange btn--magnetic" data-magnetic>Get a Free Quote</a>
      </div>
      <div class="service-detail__media">
        <div class="service-detail__img-wrap city-img-placeholder">
          <div class="img-placeholder-inner" aria-hidden="true">
            <svg width="48" height="48" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="1"><rect x="3" y="3" width="18" height="18" rx="2"/><circle cx="8.5" cy="8.5" r="1.5"/><polyline points="21 15 16 10 5 21"/></svg>
            <span>Photo coming soon</span>
          </div>
        </div>
      </div>
    </div>
  </section>

  <!-- ==================== RAT PROOFING ==================== -->
  <section class="service-detail service-detail--alt" id="rat-proofing" aria-labelledby="ratHeading">
    <div class="container service-detail__grid">
      <div class="service-detail__media">
        <div class="service-detail__img-wrap city-img-placeholder">
          <div class="img-placeholder-inner" aria-hidden="true">
            <svg width="48" height="48" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="1"><rect x="3" y="3" width="18" height="18" rx="2"/><circle cx="8.5" cy="8.5" r="1.5"/><polyline points="21 15 16 10 5 21"/></svg>
            <span>Photo coming soon</span>
          </div>
        </div>
      </div>
      <div class="service-detail__body">
        <span class="label-tag reveal-text">RAT PROOFING</span>
        <h2 class="service-detail__title split-heading" id="ratHeading">LA has a roof rat problem. Your attic might too.</h2>
        <p class="service-detail__text reveal-text">Roof rats are one of the most common wildlife issues in Los Angeles. They're agile climbers that enter homes through gaps as small as a quarter-inch — and in LA's older housing stock, those gaps are everywhere: open soffit vents, damaged fascia boards, gaps around pipe penetrations, and deteriorated roof-to-wall joints.</p>
        <p class="service-detail__text reveal-text">Once inside your attic, rats nest in insulation, chew through wiring, and leave behind droppings contaminated with bacteria and Hantavirus. Most homeowners don't discover the problem until the damage is severe. Insulara's exclusion specialists conduct a full perimeter inspection of your roofline, soffits, and foundation — identifying every entry point and permanently sealing it with galvanized steel mesh and professional-grade sealant that rats cannot chew through.</p>

        <div class="city-stats reveal-text" aria-label="Key facts">
          <div class="city-stat">
            <span class="city-stat__value">¼"</span>
            <span class="city-stat__label">All rats need to enter your home</span>
          </div>
          <div class="city-stat">
            <span class="city-stat__value">#1</span>
            <span class="city-stat__label">Chewed wiring — leading cause of house fires</span>
          </div>
          <div class="city-stat">
            <span class="city-stat__value">Guaranteed</span>
            <span class="city-stat__label">Written rodent-free guarantee on every job</span>
          </div>
        </div>

        <ul class="service-detail__list reveal-text">
          <li>Full roofline and soffit inspection</li>
          <li>Galvanized steel mesh sealing on all vents and gaps</li>
          <li>Fascia board and eave gap sealing</li>
          <li>Pipe sleeve and utility penetration exclusion</li>
          <li>Contaminated insulation removal and decontamination</li>
          <li>New insulation re-installation after cleanup</li>
        </ul>
        <a href="/contact" class="btn btn--orange btn--magnetic" data-magnetic>Book Inspection</a>
      </div>
    </div>
  </section>

  <!-- ==================== WHY INSULARA IN LA ==================== -->
  <section class="why-us" aria-labelledby="whyLaHeading">
    <div class="container">
      <div class="section-header">
        <span class="label-tag reveal-text">WHY INSULARA</span>
        <h2 class="section-title split-heading" id="whyLaHeading">Los Angeles' trusted insulation and exclusion team.</h2>
      </div>
      <div class="why-us__grid">

        <div class="why-card reveal-up">
          <div class="why-card__icon" aria-hidden="true">
            <svg width="28" height="28" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="1.5"><path d="M21 10c0 7-9 13-9 13s-9-6-9-13a9 9 0 0 1 18 0z"/><circle cx="12" cy="10" r="3"/></svg>
          </div>
          <h3>Local Experts</h3>
          <p>We've worked in every LA neighborhood, from the Valley to South Bay. We know the homes, the climate, and the rodent patterns specific to Los Angeles.</p>
        </div>

        <div class="why-card reveal-up" style="--delay:0.1s">
          <div class="why-card__icon" aria-hidden="true">
            <svg width="28" height="28" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="1.5"><path d="M12 22s8-4 8-10V5l-8-3-8 3v7c0 6 8 10 8 10z"/></svg>
          </div>
          <h3>Licensed &amp; Certified</h3>
          <p>CSLB licensed, BPI certified, OSHA trained. Every technician is background-checked and certified in Hantavirus safety protocols.</p>
        </div>

        <div class="why-card reveal-up" style="--delay:0.2s">
          <div class="why-card__icon" aria-hidden="true">
            <svg width="28" height="28" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="1.5"><circle cx="12" cy="12" r="10"/><polyline points="12 6 12 12 16 14"/></svg>
          </div>
          <h3>Same-Week Scheduling</h3>
          <p>We know your time matters. Most Los Angeles inspections are booked within 48 hours. Work is typically scheduled within the same week.</p>
        </div>

        <div class="why-card reveal-up" style="--delay:0.3s">
          <div class="why-card__icon" aria-hidden="true">
            <svg width="28" height="28" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="1.5"><polyline points="20 6 9 17 4 12"/></svg>
          </div>
          <h3>Written Guarantee</h3>
          <p>Every rat proofing job comes with a written rodent-free guarantee. If they return, so do we — at no charge.</p>
        </div>

      </div>
    </div>
  </section>

  <!-- CTA -->
  <section class="cta-banner" aria-labelledby="laCtaHeading">
    <div class="noise" aria-hidden="true"></div>
    <div class="cta-banner__bg" aria-hidden="true"></div>
    <div class="container cta-banner__inner">
      <div class="cta-banner__text">
        <h2 class="cta-banner__headline split-heading" id="laCtaHeading">Serving Los Angeles —<br>book your free inspection.</h2>
        <p class="cta-banner__sub reveal-text">No obligation. We inspect, identify every issue, and give you a clear written quote before any work begins.</p>
      </div>
      <div class="cta-banner__action reveal-text">
        <a href="/contact" class="btn btn--orange btn--xl btn--magnetic" data-magnetic>Book Free Inspection</a>
      </div>
    </div>
  </section>

</main>

<%- include('partials/footer') %>

<script src="https://cdnjs.cloudflare.com/ajax/libs/gsap/3.12.5/gsap.min.js" defer></script>
